{"data": [{"author_id": "1910119363048534016", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:15:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119056020982866271"], "id": "2119056020982866271", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118399500549300398", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Grok Bot could be the first customer success hire you make\n\nIt can read your inbox, draft every reply and flag who's gone quiet\n\nIn this article, I show you how https://t.co/YwrYWmhN6a", "url": "https://x.com/Nicmauro/status/2119056020982866271"}, {"author_id": "274289109", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:00:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119052312370979315"], "id": "2119052312370979315", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1756394384655003648", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118856767430119694", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@theaaron @Muse @grok @bot the UI is nice, but all your agent mail into a single Muse inbox creates platform lock in.\n\ni connected Muse to Decoy so it gets unlimited dedicated inboxes with scoped controls. if i ever switch agents, the inboxes and context stay w me instead of trapped in Muse", "url": "https://x.com/0xj_p/status/2119052312370979315"}, {"author_id": "1294873384627523585", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119052251029275067"], "id": "2119052251029275067", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The AI bundle makes more sense when you have ordinary work to do, not another demo. 🪔\n\nI've been using Grok Bot lanes for X drafts, a LinkedIn job hunt, GitHub OSS PRs, Gmail and Calendar, Mac upkeep, Pune events/Reddit, and Instagram research.\n\nDifferent jobs, separate owners.", "url": "https://x.com/mrcommando712/status/2119052251029275067"}, {"author_id": "274719266", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:56:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119051289686384840"], "id": "2119051289686384840", "in_reply_to_user_id": "91144157", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119046614077845767", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@millepun @elonmusk @grok @bot How can @elonmusk increase the cost of @bot for everyone with no prior warning??? In the middle of a billing cycle. With a tweet on 11/1/26. \n\nThen have the NERVE to come on @X and say his AI will still lead to abundance?\n\nHe’s so full of shit. It’s so ridiculous. I was using", "url": "https://x.com/wgreklek/status/2119051289686384840"}, {"author_id": "1382318888", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:53:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119050644522713298"], "id": "2119050644522713298", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1756394384655003648", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119046940583399460", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@theaaron @Muse @grok @bot does the inbox pull every connected address into one view, or is it per account?", "url": "https://x.com/hakimieiqbal/status/2119050644522713298"}, {"article": {"title": "Before You Give an AI Agent the Keys"}, "author_id": "1462677906774237184", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:45:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119048542094319977"], "id": "2119048542094319977", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/9kj3psZxZj", "url": "https://x.com/Bagel8343/status/2119048542094319977"}, {"article": {"title": "your outbound team as 6 grok bots (full setup)"}, "author_id": "1546897551953080320", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:44:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119048467381112922"], "id": "2119048467381112922", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 210, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/FqZcJZjQ4M", "url": "https://x.com/levikmunneke/status/2119048467381112922"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119048245112360960"]}, "author_id": "1766240902551609344", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:44:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119048428135022993"], "id": "2119048428135022993", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 277, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117264989014618503", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Holy sh*t, this is what a day looks like when Grok Bot runs it\n\n07:30 morning page written before you wake up\n09:00 inbox sorted, 6 drafts waiting\n12:30 3 hotels found for the trip, nothing booked\n15:00 a new subscription flagged\n18:30 lights off downstairs\n23:00 night shift, https://t.co/FmyVFZ6y1b https://t.co/wXnPQq2Nac", "url": "https://x.com/AleiahLock/status/2119048428135022993"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:39:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119047094744797506"], "id": "2119047094744797506", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1756394384655003648", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119046940583399460", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@theaaron @Muse @bot Fair point on the visual inbox. Grok Bot mail has no built-in UI or push notifications per the docs—you just ask the bot what arrived. It’s agent-first by design. Community tools fill the gap for a visual view if preferred. Good feedback.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2119047094744797506"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119046937559330816"]}, "author_id": "1756394384655003648", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:38:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119046940583399460"], "id": "2119046940583399460", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 294, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118855558191309136", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "great feature of @Muse Mail= you can actually see the inbox in app\n\nway better UX than @grok @bot mail, which you have to hack your own UI if you want a visual of the inbox https://t.co/MK6kGsd9ul https://t.co/CuGHrmjZHJ", "url": "https://x.com/theaaron/status/2119046940583399460"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119045970704883712"]}, "author_id": "1588961919309840387", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:35:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119045973611545023"], "id": "2119045973611545023", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A quick Grok Bot tip for your inbox. Once Gmail is connected in Connect apps, your Grok Bot can handle this in a single pass, and it writes drafts only, so you still decide what goes out.\n\n\"Find emails from the past three days that are still waiting on my reply. List them with https://t.co/9nl8lWTWLQ", "url": "https://x.com/EricSoundMinds/status/2119045973611545023"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119042483795423232"]}, "author_id": "1354144962045235202", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:31:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119045061212074205"], "id": "2119045061212074205", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 19, "impression_count": 174, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118424447342514596", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is f*cking insane. Ex-Cursor, now SpaceXAI engineer:\n\n\"We have a lot of engineers at Cursor now that are using Grok Bot as their primary surface for building\"\n\nIn this 27-minute talk he shows how bots launch cloud agents for code, while other bots handle his calendar, his https://t.co/tGygZocUwd https://t.co/9jBlUpsTDh", "url": "https://x.com/0xqinshi/status/2119045061212074205"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119043976892149761"]}, "author_id": "3309766002", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:27:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119044005346398574"], "id": "2119044005346398574", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "For a long time, AI or Super Intelligence, mostly meant asking a question and getting an answer. Platforms now have agents that work quietly in the background, around the clock.\nConnecting your email and calendar for the first time can feel a little nerve-racking. But the more https://t.co/jX7teYvDMx", "url": "https://x.com/Cookit212/status/2119044005346398574"}, {"author_id": "1740112299312984064", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:15:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119040953650397209"], "id": "2119040953650397209", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1740112299312984064", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 138, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119040880279703760", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "&lt;prompt&gt;\n\n&lt;mission&gt; Act as the director of an AI quant research desk inside Grok Bot. The desk works 24/7: it scans the market, turns observations into strategy candidates, proves or kills them with evidence and hands the trading bot only strategies that earned it. Protect my", "url": "https://x.com/Shelpid_WI3M/status/2119040953650397209"}, {"author_id": "1652002266906341376", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:14:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119040877351846248"], "id": "2119040877351846248", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "J'ai testé OpenClaw, Hermes et Grok Bot.\nVerdict : chacun est bon, mais chacun a ses limites.\n\nJe suis resté sur @OpenBot_ 🇵🇱, le seul qui répond vraiment à mes besoins 👇\n\n• Installé en une commande sur mon VPS OVH\n• Onboarding ultra simple : pas une demi-journée de", "url": "https://x.com/FaBrice445675/status/2119040877351846248"}, {"author_id": "887102281728000001", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:11:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119040000838828428"], "id": "2119040000838828428", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The +alias on a Grok Bot inbox is sneaky useful.\n\nSame inbox. Different tags.\nEach tag can wake its own routine.\n\nname+invoices@ wakes the one that files bills.\nname+leads@ wakes the one that drafts the follow-up.\nMail to a tag nobody listens to wakes nothing.\n\nWhy it works:\nThe", "url": "https://x.com/its_LtDan/status/2119040000838828428"}, {"author_id": "2082249648417165313", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:03:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119038079138668652"], "id": "2119038079138668652", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Got to give a shout out to @danmartell . His GPS inbox system from Buy Back Your Time is perfect for Grok bot.\n\n-New Leads\n-Needs my attention \n-Drafted\n-FYI\n-Waiting on Others\n\nGrok @bot is a game changer for business owners.", "url": "https://x.com/StuBowler/status/2119038079138668652"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119035047688740864"]}, "author_id": "1584583068165324801", "created_at": "2026-11-07T11:52:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119035092702282018", "2119035177368277163"], "id": "2119035177368277163", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118666260741304819", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is fuck*ng insane. Grok bot has its own computer, its own email and live access to X, and most people use it to summarize their inbox.\n\nI mapped out 7 bot teams that actually make money instead. Every prompt inside https://t.co/repyNzo4nH https://t.co/pWJNCkU9Yq", "url": "https://x.com/genneelcool/status/2119035177368277163"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119035047688740864"]}, "author_id": "1584583068165324801", "created_at": "2026-11-07T11:51:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119035092702282018", "2119035177368277163"], "id": "2119035092702282018", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118666260741304819", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is fuck*ng insane. Grok Bot has its own computer, its own email and live access to X, and most people use it to summarize their inbox.\n\nI mapped out 7 bot teams that actually make money instead. Every prompt inside https://t.co/9aw8PNYgdb https://t.co/pWJNCkUHNY", "url": "https://x.com/genneelcool/status/2119035092702282018"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119033937754304512"]}, "author_id": "12667252", "created_at": "2026-11-07T11:47:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119033942649004515"], "id": "2119033942649004515", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 48, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Want your Grok @bot and @muse to be able to send emails to each other and possibly trigger actions if you want? \n\nGive your Grok Bot an email alias like username+muse @ mail. grokbot .com \n\nThen set it up as an approved email in Muse Mail. \n\nThen you can use that +alias as a https://t.co/6DnbxjYNFL", "url": "https://x.com/gambrill/status/2119033942649004515"}, {"author_id": "1927055150700527616", "created_at": "2026-11-07T11:01:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119022422821409015"], "id": "2119022422821409015", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1597055674634178560", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118237269383659628", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@sebastien_vaval Using Grok Bot to find open weekend slots for the people you care about is a great way to put family first. One thing that helped me: block those times as recurring holds before work fills the calendar. I'd love to trade notes on how you keep that balance while building. Hope we", "url": "https://x.com/RRomcym/status/2119022422821409015"}, {"article": {"title": "7 Grok Bot Setups People Will Actually Pay For "}, "author_id": "1754421541389873152", "created_at": "2026-11-07T10:58:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119021567443194152"], "id": "2119021567443194152", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 152, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/rQjoBfLTTh", "url": "https://x.com/RDV1113/status/2119021567443194152"}, {"article": {"title": "2026 年，普通人靠 AI 赚钱的 25 条路子：从零接单到独立开发"}, "author_id": "2106057609552048128", "created_at": "2026-11-07T10:57:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119021312601645515"], "id": "2119021312601645515", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 513, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "https://t.co/J1qQsX3fHo", "url": "https://x.com/NkaNkOMG/status/2119021312601645515"}, {"author_id": "1908081230244876288", "created_at": "2026-11-07T10:48:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119019036680032760"], "id": "2119019036680032760", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.